 # API

-JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.
+JSON in, JSON out. Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>` on every request.
+Keys are configured in `apiKeys` in the data file. A viewer may GET routes
+except `/audit`; a cook may also cook recipes, record waste, log temperatures,
+and enter stock-take counts. A manager may use every route. Missing or unknown
+keys return `unauthorized` (401); insufficient permissions return `forbidden`
+(403). Successful data-changing requests are recorded in the audit log.

